@@ -6,3 +6,11 @@ package holds the order book, in TypeScript; the shop's website and its staff to
 `src/index.ts`.
 
 Prices are integer cents everywhere. Run the tests with `npm test`.
+
+## Discount codes
+
+`orders.applyCode(orderNumber, code)` gives an order one discount code; a second code replaces the first.
+`SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items (half a cent rounds up); `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off and needs items of 30.00 € or
+more. An unknown code, or one the order does not qualify for, is refused with an error and the order is unchanged.
+`totals` shows the discount as `discountCents`; it never touches shipping, and free shipping is decided on the items
+before any discount.
